bmatrix}4 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =4\\cdot 2+2\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =8+6 \\\\  & =14.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299685 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100873 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "71ff07eb-2e16-529e-b17c-1bf7cb9703bd" :knowledge-point/title "Finding an Entry of the Product of Two Matrices" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050407 :topic/title "Multiplying Matrices"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4d67c225-ea5d-5fbe-a116-cd581c4a82c4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297872}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4d67c225-ea5d-5fbe-a116-cd581c4a82c4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297872} :answer-field/id #uuid "0b459b10-8619-5f0d-afdd-56b9910358fb" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298672}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "0cf7bab6-9aaa-53a5-ad4b-30e1807bc5dc" :question/math-academy-id "q-318462" :question/problem "Let $P=QR.$ What is the value of ${p}_{31}$, if\n\n$$\nQ=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix},\\,R=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}?\n$$\n\n${p}_{31}=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Multiplying the $3$rd row in $Q$ by the $1$st column in $R$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{p}_{31} & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =2(5)+1(-3)+(-2)(1) \\\\  & =10-3-2 \\\\  & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 1759